PLAN demo 1

GLOBAL
  AGENTS max 2
  PERMIT read **
  PERMIT write src/** tests/**
  PERMIT run pytest
  TOOL edit hashline
  FLOW read -> edit -> verify -> report
END

TASK one
  GOAL Add the module.
  OUTPUT module = one
  FILES src/one.py
  VERIFY pytest tests/test_one.py
END

TASK two
  GOAL Add the module.
  STEP Import ${one.package} in the module.
  FILES src/two.py
  VERIFY pytest tests/test_two.py
END
